  "iec81346_class": "2- or 3-letter IEC 81346-2:2019 class chosen from the table of the optional uniwire-data-iec81346 package (Wikipedia table \"IEC 81346\", CC BY-SA 4.0, derived from the CCI classification). null: no class of the table matches (utility grid, cross-reference, spare, generic load, household appliance, EV charger). The \"iec81346\" letter remains the letter customarily used on diagrams and may differ from the class (e.g. RCD: letter Q, class FBA \"Residual current device\")."
 }
